    <section className="feature-section" id="features"><div className="section-heading"><span className="eyebrow">LESS FRICTION, MORE LEARNING</span><h2>Everything you need to <span className="gradient-text">move forward.</span></h2><p>One connected workspace for turning information into understanding.</p></div><div className="feature-grid"><Feature icon={<FileText/>} tone="lavender" title="Smart study kits" text="Transform your material into organized notes, summaries, and revision guides."/><Feature icon={<ClipboardCheck/>} tone="blue" title="Practice that teaches" text="Create quizzes, review explanations, and learn from every mistake."/><Feature icon={<Layers/>} tone="mint" title="Memory-friendly cards" text="Revise key ideas with simple flashcards and spaced review."/><Feature icon={<BrainCircuit/>} tone="peach" title="Find your weak spots" text="Spot topics that need more attention and focus your next session."/><Feature icon={<CalendarDays/>} tone="blue" title="A plan that adapts" text="Organize study tasks around your exams, goals, and available time."/><Feature icon={<BarChart3/>} tone="lavender" title="See your progress" text="Follow your study activity, practice accuracy, and milestones over time."/></div></section>
